    "detailed_description": "<br>An action RPG inspired by Japanese mythology<br>Developed by 3Dwiz<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/429b8586d670d2e704f5939383ed01ee.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.poster.avif?t=1707833873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.webm?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.mp4?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this captivating story-driven action RPG, you will battle your way through hordes of enemies using a variety of weapons and abilities. You will also be able to choose how to develop your weapons to create your own unique playstyle. The combat system is complex, but easy to learn, allowing any player to jump in and start having fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/256342127005b084e49fdbcf5bf11379.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.poster.avif?t=1707833873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.webm?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.mp4?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In addition to the intense combat, you will also be able to explore the breathtaking scapes of ancient Japan. Immerse yourself in the vibrant culture and explore the many stunning locations in the game. From the mystical places of legends to the more down to earth scapes, you will be able to experience the beauty of mythological Japan in all its glory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/106dd3e6aa8af6035fa96b4d3e29431e.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>In Tsukichi, you follow the story of the protagonist, Tsukichi, as she embarks on a dangerous journey to discover the mysteries behind her newfound powers. Along the way, you will traverse the beautiful landscapes of Japan and explore the secrets of a mysterious civilization that tries to infiltrate and take over Japan.<br><br> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play Tsukichi?</h2>Tsukichi is a captivating game that will keep you entertained for hours. With its unique blend of story, combat, and exploration, you are sure to have an incredible experience. <br><br><strong>So, if you're looking for an action RPG with an engaging story, intense combat, and beautiful scapes, you won't want to miss out on Tsukichi.</strong><br><br>Join Tsukichi on her journey to discover the secrets of a dormant civilization and experience the beauty of Japan! <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whishlist now!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<br>An action RPG inspired by Japanese mythology<br>Developed by 3Dwiz<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/429b8586d670d2e704f5939383ed01ee.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.poster.avif?t=1707833873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.webm?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/c1658c7bddd5a10a08dba2883e062732.mp4?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In this captivating story-driven action RPG, you will battle your way through hordes of enemies using a variety of weapons and abilities. You will also be able to choose how to develop your weapons to create your own unique playstyle. The combat system is complex, but easy to learn, allowing any player to jump in and start having fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/256342127005b084e49fdbcf5bf11379.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.poster.avif?t=1707833873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.webm?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/6a85a1c34e5ab43d9bb1615f3b326113.mp4?t=1707833873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In addition to the intense combat, you will also be able to explore the breathtaking scapes of ancient Japan. Immerse yourself in the vibrant culture and explore the many stunning locations in the game. From the mystical places of legends to the more down to earth scapes, you will be able to experience the beauty of mythological Japan in all its glory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413300/extras/106dd3e6aa8af6035fa96b4d3e29431e.avif?t=1707833873\" /></span><br>In Tsukichi, you follow the story of the protagonist, Tsukichi, as she embarks on a dangerous journey to discover the mysteries behind her newfound powers. Along the way, you will traverse the beautiful landscapes of Japan and explore the secrets of a mysterious civilization that tries to infiltrate and take over Japan.<br><br> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play Tsukichi?</h2>Tsukichi is a captivating game that will keep you entertained for hours. With its unique blend of story, combat, and exploration, you are sure to have an incredible experience. <br><br><strong>So, if you're looking for an action RPG with an engaging story, intense combat, and beautiful scapes, you won't want to miss out on Tsukichi.</strong><br><br>Join Tsukichi on her journey to discover the secrets of a dormant civilization and experience the beauty of Japan! <h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whishlist now!</h2>",
